       _d_e_v_i_c_e
           The disk device.

       _p_a_r_t_i_t_i_o_n
           The partition number.

       _l_e_n_g_t_h
           The new length of the partition (in 512-byte sectors).

       --hh, ----hheellpp
           Display help text and exit.

       --VV, ----vveerrssiioonn
           Print version and exit.

